# Summary

The charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter [[cite:obs-5ed233ed2b96239b12e0b7100c8a7f8932896d89 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]].

The annex specifies that the ordinary contributions are one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January [[cite:obs-dffe74aa40a2118ac65df49c828d1a0bc11a9a3b "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]].
